HINT:  A superuser can run the statement on every node by hand with kingres_shard.enable_routing = off.
CREATE INDEX ug_v_idx ON ug (v);
ERROR:  CREATE INDEX is not supported on distributed tables yet
DETAIL:  The statement would change distributed table "ug" on this node only, but the table exists on every node of the cluster; running DDL on every node is a later phase.
HINT:  A superuser can run the statement on every node by hand with kingres_shard.enable_routing = off.
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX ug_v_uidx ON ug (id, v);
ERROR:  CREATE INDEX is not supported on distributed tables yet
DETAIL:  The statement would change distributed table "ug" on this node only, but the table exists on every node of the cluster; running DDL on every node is a later phase.
HINT:  A superuser can run the statement on every node by hand with kingres_shard.enable_routing = off.
CREATE INDEX ug_b_idx ON ug_b0000 (v);
ERROR:  CREATE INDEX is not supported on distributed tables yet
DETAIL:  The statement would change distributed table "ug" on this node only, but the table exists on every node of the cluster; running DDL on every node is a later phase.
HINT:  A superuser can run the statement on every node by hand with kingres_shard.enable_routing = off.
DROP TABLE ug;
ERROR:  DROP TABLE is not supported on distributed tables yet
DETAIL:  The statement would change distributed table "ug" on this node only, but the table exists on every node of the cluster; running DDL on every node is a later phase.
HINT:  A superuser can run the statement on every node by hand with kingres_shard.enable_routing = off.
DROP TABLE ug_plain, ug;
ERROR:  DROP TABLE is not supported on distributed tables yet
DETAIL:  The statement would change distributed table "ug" on this node only, but the table exists on every node of the cluster; running DDL on every node is a later phase.
HINT:  A superuser can run the statement on every node by hand with kingres_shard.enable_routing = off.
DROP INDEX ug_pkey;
ERROR:  DROP INDEX is not supported on distributed tables yet
DETAIL:  The statement would change distributed table "ug" on this node only, but the table exists on every node of the cluster; running DDL on every node is a later phase.
HINT:  A superuser can run the statement on every node by hand with kingres_shard.enable_routing = off.
DROP SCHEMA ugs CASCADE;
ERROR:  DROP SCHEMA is not supported on distributed tables yet
DETAIL:  The statement would change distributed table "other" on this node only, but the table exists on every node of the cluster; running DDL on every node is a later phase.
HINT:  A superuser can run the statement on every node by hand with kingres_shard.enable_routing = off.
DROP TYPE ug_color CASCADE;
NOTICE:  drop cascades to 5 other objects
DETAIL:  drop cascades to column c of table ug_c
drop cascades to column c of table ug_c_b0000
drop cascades to column c of table ug_c_b0001
drop cascades to column c of table ug_c_b0002
drop cascades to column c of table ug_c_b0003
ERROR:  DROP is not supported on distributed tables yet
DETAIL:  The statement would drop distributed table public.ug_c, or one of its columns, on this node only.
HINT:  Drop it on every node with kingres_shard.enable_routing = off, as a superuser, if you can keep the nodes consistent yourself.
COPY ug (id) FROM '/dev/null';
ERROR:  COPY FROM is not supported on distributed tables yet
DETAIL:  The statement would change distributed table "ug" on this node only, but the table exists on every node of the cluster; running DDL on every node is a later phase.
HINT:  A superuser can run the statement on every node by hand with kingres_shard.enable_routing = off.
CREATE TRIGGER ug_trg BEFORE INSERT ON ug FOR EACH ROW EXECUTE FUNCTION suppress_redundant_updates_trigger();
ERROR:  CREATE TRIGGER is not supported on distributed tables yet
DETAIL:  The statement would change distributed table "ug" on this node only, but the table exists on every node of the cluster; running DDL on every node is a later phase.
HINT:  A superuser can run the statement on every node by hand with kingres_shard.enable_routing = off.
